WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.385
How few crossings?

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.505
Seven dots, every pair joined. This drawing

3
00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:07.823
has nine crossings, exactly the formula.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.291
The proof turns any drawing into polynomials,

5
00:00:11.291 --> 00:00:13.254
each claiming its own crossing pair.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.058
So no drawing beats the formula.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.846
Checked in Lean.
